sle—pick from a library of trendy badges, enamel charms, pins, stickers, \u0026 more. |\n| **Zero‑Cost Mock‑Up** | Visualise your concept instantly—no need to wait for a prototype. |\n| **High‑Resolution Prints** | Professional, vibrant colors that last through washes and wear. |\n| **Fast Turnaround** | From design to shipment in a few days—because great ideas never wait. |\n| **Eco‑Friendly Materials** | Sustainable options for the conscientious creator. |\n| **Unlimited Customization** | Add logos, text, graphics, or even hand‑drawn artwork with our intuitive editor. |\n\n---\n\n### 3 Simple Steps to Create Your Dream Design\n\n1. **Choose Your Product**  \n   - Badges, enamel charms, stickers, pins, keychains… Browse by style or search with keywords.  \n   - Preview each item in 3‑D or 360° to see how it will look before you customize.\n\n2. **Design It Your Way**  \n   - Drag and drop your logo, text, or artwork.  \n   - Use our color picker, fonts, and textures to match your brand or personal aesthetic.  \n   - Resize, rotate, or duplicate—no limits!\n\n3. **Order \u0026 Share**  \n   - Add to cart, review your mock‑up, and place an order.  \n   - Receive a digital proof before final production, or skip the proof for a quicker turnaround.  \n   - Share your finished piece on social, gift it, or launch your next merch line!\n\n---\n\n### Inspiration Gallery\n\n\u003e **“Tech Startup Badges”** – Sleek metallic finishes with company logos.  \n\u003e **“Wedding Enamel Charms”** – Hand‑painted hearts, customized with names \u0026 dates.  \n\u003e **“Music Festival Stickers”** – Vibrant, glossy designs that stick with the crowd.  \n\n*(Visit our website for the full gallery and customer spotlights.)*\n\n---\n\n### Need a Hand?\n\n- **Design Consultation** – Drop us a DM or email at `design@printcious.com` for a quick walkthrough.  \n- **Bulk Orders** – Get discounted rates on large quantities—perfect for events, teams, or giveaways.  \n- **Print‑Ready Files** – We’ll review and optimize your artwork for the best results.\n\n---\n\n**Ready to bring your ideas to life?**  \n👉 **[Start Designing Now](https://www.printcious.com)**\n\nLet Printcious be the canvas for your creativity—because the only limit is your imagination. 🎨✨","annotations":[],"logprobs":null}]}],"previous_response_id":null,"model":"openai/gpt-oss-20b","reasoning":{"effort":"medium"},"max_output_tokens":null,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"}},"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","truncation":"disabled","metadata":{},"temperature":1,"top_p":1,"user":null,"service_tier":"default","background":false,"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":96,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":881,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":268},"total_tokens":977},"parallel_tool_calls":true,"store":false,"top_logprobs":null,"max_tool_calls":null}


